WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.601
-Welcome back
to "The Tonight Show!"

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.400
I'm here with the one and only
Heidi Klum,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.634
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:12.167
And we're about to play a game
called "Auto-Tune Up."

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:14.734
Here we go.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:17.300
-♪ Auto ♪

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.667
♪ Tune ♪

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.667
♪ Up, yeah ♪

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:25.701
[ Vocalizes ]

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.701
-Here's how it works,
we're going to take turns

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:29.167
hitting this button,
and it will select

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.200
a random,
boring paragraph.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.367
And our job is to turn it
into an awesome song

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.901
with the help of Auto-Tune.
Are you ready for this?

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:37.200
-Yes.,
-I think it'll be great.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.033
Alright. I will go first to show
you what we're doing.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.901
Let's see what I'm auto-tuning.
Start the generator, please.

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:49.200
"A guide to spring break
in Daytona Beach, Florida."

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.767
So many things to do in Florida
on spring break.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.367
Alright, here we go.

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:56.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.801 --> 00:01:01.701
♪♪

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:40.601
No idea.
-How are you so good at this?

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:43.334
-I had no idea what I said
or what was happening.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:46.033
Alright. Get ready, Heidi.
It is your turn.

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.267
Let's see what's on,
the generator.

00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:48.534
Let's start the generator.

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:50.267
Then you press this whenever
you're ready to stop it.

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:56.334
-"A negative Amazon review
for a dog stroller."

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.167
-Yeah. Alright, so someone
bought a dog stroller

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.667
and they posted
a negative review.

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:03.100
Now, Heidi Klum, you're going to
make this into a giant hit.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.033
-Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:06.968
♪♪

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:12.901
-[ Distorted voice ]
♪ Ow! ♪

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.300
♪ Oh it did, oh it did ♪

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.968
♪ It did, it did,
it did, it did ♪

00:02:41.968 --> 00:02:44.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.334
-Yes.
-How.

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:47.133
-You know.

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.701
You know what
the funny thing is?

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.033
-What?
-What the funny thing is,

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:53.200
you put this Auto-Tune on
I sound the same way

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.334
I always sound!
-No, no. It's not true!

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:57.567
-You tricked me!
-You sounded like you sung

00:02:57.567 --> 00:02:58.834
that song or something before.

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:02.868
Okay. It is. It is -- right?
Okay, it's my turn.

00:03:02.868 --> 00:03:07.634
Let's see what I'm singing.
Let's start the generator here.

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:11.534
"A list of Baylor University's
basketball coaching staff."

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:13.801
-Oh, Boy.
-So this is just a list

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:15.934
of Baylor University's
coaching staff.

00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.434
Okay, here we go.
-Okay.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:19.167
Alright.
Wish me luck.

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:28.968
♪♪

00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:43.501
♪ And John Jakus ♪

00:03:43.501 --> 00:03:44.667
♪ John Jakus ♪

00:03:44.667 --> 00:03:50.167
♪ John Jakus, John ♪

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:52.300
♪ And finally ♪

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:57.000
♪ I said,
Alvin Brooks III ♪

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.767
♪ Yes, yeah ♪

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:03.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.067 --> 00:04:06.234
-I'm crying a little bit.
-I broke a sweat on that one.

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:10.033
Okay, our last song.
Let's start generator here.

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:11.901
-I need this thing at home.
-I know.

00:04:11.901 --> 00:04:14.834
Oh, shoot.

00:04:14.834 --> 00:04:17.300
-Wait.
-"A YouTube comment for

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.267
the Obi-Wan Kenobi trailer."

00:04:19.267 --> 00:04:21.601
-That's right. So they just --
the trailer just came out.

00:04:21.601 --> 00:04:23.234
This is a comment of the trailer

00:04:23.234 --> 00:04:24.868
that was just
released on YouTube.

00:04:24.868 --> 00:04:26.634
-Oh!

00:04:26.634 --> 00:04:31.567
♪♪

00:04:56.667 --> 00:05:02.701
♪ Fire emoji ♪

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:04.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Come on now.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.300
You also, you
have the moves as well.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.968
That's a jam right there,
Heidi Klum.

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:11.868
I love you.

00:05:11.868 --> 00:05:14.634
-Her new song "Chai Tea
with Heidi" is available now.

